{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"needs_more_public_schema","failure_reason":"The available Spotify read APIs expose queue and playback state but no liked-state field. Therefore, after calling spotify.like_song, the executor cannot re-query a public read API to verify that every selected song is liked as required.","missing_public_schema_fields":["spotify.show_song_queue.response.items[].is_liked (or an equivalent public read API exposing whether each song is liked)"],"task_id":"ccb4494_3","task_family":"ccb4494","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"A compliant mutation plan cannot be completed until Spotify liked state is publicly readable for postcondition verification.","steps":[]}